      "id": "claim_b8f290d6d8264663908aae0206f31320",
      "statement": "Harness profiles are stored in a process-global registry under the versioned Symbol.for key deepagents.harness-profiles.v1; the registry tracks profiles, the built-in-key baseline, and whether built-ins have loaded. Lookups and public registrations lazily bootstrap built-ins, and the built-in loader snapshots its keys after registration.",
