      "id": "claim_1e7fa8b224c64cb3a91645593d94d006",
      "statement": "For a valid provider:model lookup, getHarnessProfile checks the exact model key and the bare provider key; when both exist it merges the provider profile as base with the exact profile as override, otherwise it returns whichever match exists. Empty halves and specs with multiple colons return undefined without consulting the registry.",
