      "id": "claim_01040af921134af5a8acb1252c0b1560",
      "statement": "resolveHarnessProfile is total: an explicit spec drives direct lookup, while a model instance without a spec is tried as provider:identifier, then as a colon-containing identifier, then by provider alone; unmatched resolution returns the shared EMPTY_HARNESS_PROFILE.",
