      "statement": "createHarnessProfile produces a frozen, normalized profile: tool-description overrides use a null-prototype object, exclusion arrays become Sets, general-purpose settings are copied and frozen, and middleware remains a static runtime array or factory. It validates excludedMiddleware names and rejects empty names, class-path syntax, private underscore names, and required FilesystemMiddleware or SubAgentMiddleware scaffolding.",
