      "id": "claim_9c9fa75baa4849649e54a93a93d83222",
      "statement": "mergeProfiles layers an override over a base by field: prompt scalars use defined override values, tool-description maps shallow-merge with override precedence, tool and middleware exclusions union, generalPurposeSubagent merges per sub-field, and extraMiddleware replaces same-name base entries in place while appending novel names. Middleware factories are resolved afresh by the merged factory.",
