      "id": "claim_cd1711410d3d4c659ba7edb680ceb579",
      "statement": "Subagent profile resolution is model-specific: a distinct subagent model is resolved independently, while a missing or identical model reuses the parent profile; the resolved subagent profile affects its filesystem tools, extra middleware, middleware exclusions, and tool exclusions. The automatically added general-purpose subagent can be disabled, customized by description or systemPrompt, and otherwise receives the parent model, effective tools, skills, and profile prompt behavior.",
